", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1437492938480719_5333136018440499492_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UEVhCsbW9vAQ7kNvwFD0L2q&_nc_oc=Adqrw1dhiTQ6LwPeUX3L2IYIPf4tH15jfL_ude1QhHBkVRkI2tdLBzAfp24JF7VVV0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTuKYglmXxuDXEUTW9yXYcQ_A2dT8L6HMTU2rwaCeDw2A&oe=6B0B4425"}, {"file_name": "01-brackenback-dunesail.png", "id": "1108240935002704", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1108240945002703_5321937716498977301_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZwvIN3TY8F0Q7kNvwEEesS3&_nc_oc=Adrf6o8U6vOp-3t4H0sV2l5z2I_xW5NL-5LF-dWrYWSc7uSRgwnG3iWUvqBwMc6sb6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ2hjgicZ4oHaE_sLsPXIexYNiksRPTbV9ep4uE743vKQ&oe=6B0B2AAB"}, {"file_name": "03-anvil.png", "id": "1743751803347179", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_1743751806680512_7086347920327905545_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=--8nre82XkQQ7kNvwHAE3l1&_nc_oc=AdoWq8R94ph7z0h1IR9vr64N28FxFVd2gTABPD6k2b98AYUMCfPLQglAN5w4Y2Q1-2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQThSNGREDiNeq2foQd828ZxwtnkCHVpAf_PlpbhDlh7KA&oe=6B0B20B6"}, {"file_name": "02-skewers-friends.png", "id": "1450016947006201", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828008_1450016957006200_6089253454472159458_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M0aYbzzaCHMQ7kNvwENFyGS&_nc_oc=Adpab6y1q1z5EWOIdxpLnXaOD_GOdrKQzF-F4mVo64uLsrqM4AzDX_ufqHFNhSzq8tg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQBRLIhqYVRfUsQ9nK8-YvJtGl7ywxSaPZajhbHDbchpQ&oe=6B0B45E1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "starworn-cover-2560x1440.png", "id": "1025693103822343", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1025693110489009_3995927389777223547_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZwmYLNhATcgQ7kNvwECK0ZP&_nc_oc=AdqBeSvk8f13dXwXgn8xkVvupWQk0Dr0hMNAQU_1goQqW9WPDy0OcGP67KlNjHvqelE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRaFQkJq8mIMFAFMHzEKDh5EgaiaETnJGgwsmhclJGBKA&oe=6B0B222B"}, "display_name": "Starworn", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Your planet is gone.**\n\nYour replicator regenerated you on an alien world. You\u2019re stranded.\n\nStarworn is a voxel survival adventure built for VR. Start with what you can find and build a base to call home. The wilderness won\u2019t make it easy.\n\n{2834768043546491}\n\n**Made by hand.**\n\nFell trees and mine the terrain. Craft your tools at the workbench, then build your shelter piece by piece.\n\n{2403177630217480}\n\n{1398518511857019}\n\n**Around the campfire.**\n\nCook what you find and keep yourself fed.\n\n{1058073027057615}\n\n**Beyond the surface.**\n\nCaves hide strange creatures and new dangers. Invite friends into your world and head underground together.\n\n{28064931916523023}\n\n**The world changes.**\n\nForests turn to autumn colours and snow. When night falls, bring a torch.\n\n{1416491647119063}\n\n**Early Access**\n\nThe first world is playable now. Future updates will expand the journey: your own spaceship, other worlds and the search for survivors\u2014and whoever destroyed your planet.\n\nTell us what you want next. Your feedback helps decide what we build.\n\nJoin at a lower launch price. We plan to raise it after the first round of feedback and improvements, and again as the game grows. Early buyers receive all future base-game updates, including the full release, at no extra cost.\n\nExpect bugs and unfinished features. Some updates may require a new world. Buy for what\u2019s playable today.", "short_description": "Your planet is gone. Your replicator regenerated you on an alien world. You\u2019re stranded. Build a base by hand in a voxel survival adventure for VR. Invite friends into your world. Early Access begins with the first world, with more to come."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://starworn.net/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holonautic", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holonautic.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2028125241240905"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4550109638591045"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4550109638591045"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792080000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4550109638591045"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2077813326272096", "version": "0.4.35"}, "id": "1075480941908333", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2028125237907572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2077813326272096"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1075480941908333"}]}, "change_log": "STARWORN 0.4.35: Smoother Like Butter\n\nNew\n\u2022 Bombs burst lumpy and actually hurt Hollows.\n\u2022 Bomb and blast bolt kills tear bodies apart, like the shotgun.\n\u2022 A blast bolt to the head drops a Veteran.\n\u2022 Surface and shallow cave bats die in one hit, Dripwings in a few.\n\u2022 More relays and fallback relays for improved connectivity.\n\nPerformance\n\u2022 Quest 3 and 3S run a lot smoother.\n\u2022 The hitch every 10 seconds is gone.\n\u2022 Hosting is smoother, and the first seconds in a world load faster.\n\u2022 Light changes don't stall the game anymore.\n\u2022 Dying doesn't freeze the frame anymore.\n\n\nBug fixes\n\u2022 Joining and finding friends works a lot more reliably.\n\u2022 Blast bolts only go off once in multiplayer.\n\u2022 The rivet tin doesn't chip machines anymore.\n\u2022 A forge or any machine placed above another machine works again.\n\u2022 Pods land beside you on open ground and never hang in the air.\n\u2022 Held tools never go invisible.\n\u2022 Lamps inside a house don't light up the outside walls.\n\u2022 Bats don't get stuck in the air anymore (hopefully).\n\u2022 Held candles don't flicker.\n\u2022 Your index finger stays curled on the trigger.\n\u2022 Snap turn waits until you push the stick far enough.\n\u2022 many other bufixes and improvments", "created_date": 1795044311, "id": "2077813326272096", "version": "0.4.35", "version_code": 16778275, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2028125237907572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2077813326272096"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1075480941908333"}]}, "change_log": "The Gunslinger Update\n\nDual wielding pistols\n- Hold a pistol in each hand and reload both without a free hand: push an empty pistol into a holster with magazines and a fresh one flies into the grip.\n- Chamber a round the physical way: push the slide against your other pistol, a wall or a table edge and it racks.\n- A locked-open slide slams home when you press it against something.\n- Your pistols go back to their own holster.\n- Rifle, pistols and the blast bolt hit twice as hard.\n\nBrutal deaths\n- The shotgun tears skeletons apart where it hits.\n- Plasma kills burn: shockwaves, burnt holes and smoke from the wound.\n\nMultiplayer\n- Friends who could not join now get in, through our own relay when their network blocks the usual way.\n- Hosting is smoother: a friend joining no longer makes your frame stutter, and your view no longer widens while your headset is already working hard.\n- Join codes show in two groups, and the multiplayer page shows your game version.\n\nPerformance\n- Big skeletons near torches cost far less to draw.\n- The freeze a few seconds after opening a world is gone, and big worlds load sooner.\n- Bases with lots of torches run lighter.\n\nFixes\n- Tables can be repaired again with a log.\n- You can place walls and roofs where nothing stands.\n- Footprints, smoke and spilled items no longer glow at night.\n- Swimming feels like water.\n- Held signs show their drawing to other players.\n- The Bramblemaw has half the health.\n- Fewer flickering creatures, no ghost tools on the robot page, no far lamps hanging in the dark.\n\nKnown issues\n- With 8 players the Proving Grounds is too small and some pods hover instead of landing; a bigger room with pod bays is coming.", "created_date": 1794436546, "id": "2070267943693301", "version": "0.4.33", "version_code": 16778273, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2028125237907572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2077813326272096"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1075480941908333"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1794330482, "id": "2069012947152134", "version": "0.4.32", "version_code": 16778272, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2028125237907572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2077813326272096"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1794247599, "id": "2068066953913400", "version": "0.4.31", "version_code": 16778271, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2028125237907572", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2077813326272096"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1794189667, "id": "2067384857314943", "version": "0.4.30", "version_code": 16778270, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}